Final Caliber was a [[Phenomena/Hearts|Heart]] of [[Org/Radiant Arms/index|Radiant Arms]], the firearm maker, and the Heart of their berth aboard the [[Org/The Harlequins/Providence|Providence]]. Its body was a cardboard box full of bullets, and the part of it that had to be plucked out was one large-caliber round among the rest. The bullets rattled and whistled as they were searched through, asking not to be killed, and could do nothing to stop it.

When Radiant Arms gave up their berth to merge into the Party's alliance, one of the Party reached in and took that bullet, and the fane came down. A round of the Heart's remaining energy went to [[Org/Iconoclasm/Eerie|Eerie]].
